{"a":[11,19],"h":"<p><svg class=\"ea\" width=\"100\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 100.3 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 16.6 25.6 25.6 33.7 40.6 48.7 48.7 56.3 56.3 70.6 77.3 77.3\" y=\"26.3 26.3 26.3 21.0 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"33.7 56.3 70.6 84.0\" y=\"26.3 21.0 26.3 26.3\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> Ya'ni öyle bir dehşetki birbirlerine gösterilip dururlarken bile soramaz, nerede kaldıki uzağı arasın 13.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"89\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 89.0 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 16.4 23.3 23.3 30.0 36.7 43.4 43.4 57.7 64.4\" y=\"25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"30.0 57.7 64.4 72.7\" y=\"25.4\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> fasîlesini - içlerinde yetiştiği ve başı sıkıldığı zaman kendisini kucaklayan, barındıran kavm-u kabîlesini, aşîretini, hemşerilerini, obasını 15.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"61\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 61.3 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 23.3 31.6 31.6 38.3 38.3\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"23.3 31.6 45.0\" y=\"25.6 20.3 25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> o - azâb ateşi <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"62\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 62.0 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 27.7 27.7 38.3\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"38.3 45.7\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> alevli salgın ateş - Cehennemin bir ismi 16.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"69\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 69.4 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 16.4 23.2 32.2 39.0 39.0 46.4\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"23.2 39.0 46.4 53.2\" y=\"26.3 21.0 26.3 26.3\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> - «<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"35\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 34.9 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 14.2 24.7\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"14.2 24.7\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> » - den hal yâhud « <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 40.1 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 14.3 14.3 21.0 21.0 30.0\" y=\"25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"30.0\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> » takdiriyle ıhtısas üzere mensubdur. Merfu' okunduğu kıraete göre haber ba'de haber veya sıfattır. Nüzu'dan saldırıcı, nezi'den, soyucu<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"81\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 80.7 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 16.4 30.0 30.0 38.2 38.2 50.2 57.0 57.0\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"38.2 64.4\" y=\"20.3 25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> -:</p><p>ŞEVÂ, el ayak gibi etraf, netekim avcı: kol, bacak gibi öldürmiyecek noktadan etrafa isabet ettirdiği zaman «<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"46\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 46.1 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 24.7 24.7 36.0\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"16.4 36.0\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> » derler. Yâhud başın derisi demek olan «<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"39\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 39.2 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 9.7 16.6 24.7\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> » ın cem'ıdir. Ya'ni eli ayağı, tepeyi tırnağı soyar « <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"447\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 446.8 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 3.0 19.6 26.3 35.3 42.0 42.0 49.6 65.3 72.0 80.3 80.3 87.0 95.3 95.3 104.3 111.0 111.0 127.6 134.3 143.3 150.7 150.7 157.6 175.6 182.3 182.3 189.7 198.0 198.0 204.7 204.7 225.7 225.7 234.7 234.7 243.7 250.6 257.3 257.3 264.7 264.7 273.7 289.6 289.6 298.6 298.6 307.6 307.6 315.0 323.3 323.3 330.0 330.0 351.0 351.0 367.6 380.3 380.3 394.6 410.3 417.0 426.0 426.0 432.7 432.7\" y=\"25.4 20.3 2